# Soft-keyword identifier fallbacks take the FULL dot+bracket postfix chain
# since the v0.23.0 pin (upstream #328): prev/at and the question words index
# and dot like plain idents outside their special forms.
prev is [1, 2]
print of prev[0]
print of prev[1:2]
at is {"k": 5}
print of at.k
prev is {"m": [7, 8]}
print of prev.m[1]
for how in [{"k": 1}]:
    print of how.k
for who in [[10, 20]]:
    print of who[1]
# special forms still win over the fallback
x is 1
x is 5
print of (prev of x)
